rl":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-07-09T02:01:03Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T16:50:00Z","closed_at":"2025-07-10T16:49:56Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5 Beta 3\n- Not reproducible in 4.4.1 Stable\n\nI'm including a .zip of the same project loaded in both versions.  \n\n[text_content_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21133327/text_content_bug.zip)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7640) - AMD Ryzen 7 5700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn my project, I use the get_content_height() and get_content_width() in tandem with visible_ratio to handle dynamic text in my dialog system.  The backdrop UI grows as the text grows in length.  In 4.4.1, it works as intended.  In 4.5 the get_content_height() and get_content_width() bypasses the visible_ratio and shows the full back panel before the text panel has fully revealed itself.  \n\n4.4.1 with visible_ratio = 1.0 on both text screens\n<img width=\"952\" height=\"534\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b131996d-d153-4449-8c3b-4db342d0dd3a\" />\n4.4.1 with visible_ratio = 0.538  and  visible_ratio = 0.313\n<img width=\"956\" height=\"538\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f002d328-709c-4a41-9d47-88d6e60a8347\" />\n4.5 Beta 3 with visible_ratio = 1.0 on both text screens\n<img width=\"956\" height=\"540\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5ff9c811-5924-43c7-af1e-81fa95e282be\" />\n4.5 Beta 3 with visible_ratio = 0.538  and  visible_ratio = 0.313\n<img width=\"954\" height=\"536\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b43825e1-b873-4988-99dc-3b08d149ea49\" />\n\n<img width=\"1177\" height=\"265\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/544800bc-726f-4de1-a757-562f31aef2a0\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1) Download the attached zip\n2) Open both projects in their respective versions (4.4.1 and 4.5 b3).\n3) Open the test_text.tscn in each, play the scenes, and see the difference in output.  They should be set up exactly the same.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[text_content_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21133358/text_content_bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108423/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}